[staff] Right this way.

249
00:18:31,110 --> 00:18:33,154
[exclaims in awe]

250
00:18:36,198 --> 00:18:39,452
[Chiko] Aw! It's pretty spacious!

251
00:18:39,535 --> 00:18:41,537
[Satoshi] You can see the whole ocean!

252
00:18:43,039 --> 00:18:44,707
[Satoshi exclaims]

253
00:18:44,790 --> 00:18:46,500
[staff] Please feel free
to take a bath first.

254
00:18:46,584 --> 00:18:48,711
Dinner will be served soon.

255
00:18:48,794 --> 00:18:50,046
Thank you so much.

256
00:18:50,129 --> 00:18:52,298
-[staff] Enjoy your stay.
-[door closes]

257
00:18:53,799 --> 00:18:55,676
What a nice place.

258
00:18:56,093 --> 00:18:58,679
-I've never stayed anywhere like this.
-Yeah...

259
00:18:59,347 --> 00:19:01,140
I knew I made the right call.

260
00:19:02,266 --> 00:19:05,061
Wow, it's huge! [chuckles]

261
00:19:05,770 --> 00:19:09,982
Propose... propose...

262
00:19:11,192 --> 00:19:13,653
propose... propose...

263
00:19:16,447 --> 00:19:19,200
[loudly] Let's go!

264
00:19:19,992 --> 00:19:23,579
-There's so much food.
-Wonder if we can eat it all.

265
00:19:29,669 --> 00:19:33,047
-It's no fun if I drink alone.
-No, I'm fine.

266
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:34,465
-Just one glass.
-Well...

267
00:19:36,801 --> 00:19:37,802
Here.

268
00:19:45,976 --> 00:19:47,978
-Bitter!
-[chuckles]

269
00:19:53,484 --> 00:19:55,152
[Chiko] What should I eat first?

270
00:19:57,446 --> 00:19:58,614
Sashimi it is.

271
00:20:02,034 --> 00:20:04,620
Mmm! So good!

272
00:20:04,704 --> 00:20:05,705
[Satoshi] Really?

273
00:20:06,330 --> 00:20:07,748
[Chiko] What are you doing?

274
00:20:11,085 --> 00:20:12,670
-[Satoshi] Hey, Chiko.
-Huh?

275
00:20:14,171 --> 00:20:17,425
We've been living together for a while now

276
00:20:18,634 --> 00:20:20,720
and we've been doing pretty well, right?

277
00:20:20,803 --> 00:20:21,887
[Chiko] I guess so.

278
00:20:26,934 --> 00:20:31,772
-Well... we're good from here on out too?
-Hopefully.

279
00:20:34,024 --> 00:20:38,279
I thought couples living together
fought every day, though.

280
00:20:43,159 --> 00:20:46,746
You mean when you lived
with that Yusaku guy?

281
00:20:52,126 --> 00:20:56,464
-Wait, no. I mean...
-Well...

282
00:21:03,345 --> 00:21:05,097
-[Satoshi sucks teeth]
-[ring box clacks]

283
00:21:13,105 --> 00:21:14,106
[softly] Sorry.

284
00:21:15,107 --> 00:21:16,192
Let me eat.

285
00:21:18,611 --> 00:21:21,030
[♪ pensive music playing]

286
00:21:42,843 --> 00:21:44,720
[Chiko] You're so quiet today.

287
00:21:45,262 --> 00:21:46,722
Re... Really?

288
00:21:55,940 --> 00:21:57,149
[Chiko] Well, shall we head back--

289
00:21:57,233 --> 00:21:59,693
Chiko! Wanna take a walk?

290
00:22:00,194 --> 00:22:02,279
Let's walk! You know...

291
00:22:04,198 --> 00:22:05,241
[Chiko] Fine.

292
00:22:31,100 --> 00:22:32,268
Chiko!

293
00:22:34,228 --> 00:22:35,354
What?

294
00:22:40,526 --> 00:22:41,527
Wait...

295
00:22:44,154 --> 00:22:45,406
Huh? Wait a minute.

296
00:22:46,073 --> 00:22:47,324
Are you kidding me?

297
00:22:50,619 --> 00:22:54,456
Huh? For real? Seriously?

298
00:22:54,540 --> 00:22:55,666
Wait a second...

299
00:22:57,793 --> 00:23:00,546
Hold on... [breathing heavily]

300
00:23:01,839 --> 00:23:03,090
It can't be.

301
00:23:11,932 --> 00:23:15,102
[breathing heavily]

302
00:23:21,483 --> 00:23:22,526
[fanny pack thuds]

303
00:23:25,237 --> 00:23:26,488
Chiko...

304
00:23:28,782 --> 00:23:29,950
What is it?

305
00:23:31,619 --> 00:23:34,038
Will you marry me?

306
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:42,671
OSAKA'S TOP FOOD PICK
OKONOMIYAKI (JAPANESE PIZZA)

307
00:23:43,589 --> 00:23:45,299
[sizzling]

308
00:23:57,853 --> 00:23:59,480
[Chiko] Can't beat butatama

309
00:23:59,563 --> 00:24:01,649
-with mayo and sauce.
-[Satoshi] True.

310
00:24:01,732 --> 00:24:02,775
TEKITEI

311
00:24:02,858 --> 00:24:05,277
[♪ closing theme music playing]
